# --output-dir: two files of the same name would be written to one file:
# a command line mistake, found before anything is formatted.
program Opp
arg --output-dir
arg tests/data/config
arg tests/data/formatted.Mod
arg tests/data/config/../formatted.Mod
status 2
output
opp: --output-dir: tests/data/formatted.Mod and tests/data/config/../formatted.Mod would both be written to tests/data/config/formatted.Mod
